CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'numa_spinlock_flag == 1'
#242: FILE: arch/x86/kernel/alternative.c:773:
+	if ((numa_spinlock_flag == 1) ||
+	    (numa_spinlock_flag == 0 && nr_node_ids > 1 &&
+		    pv_ops.lock.queued_spin_lock_slowpath ==
+			native_queued_spin_lock_slowpath)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

